⍝ D-15: ⎕TYPE sets the width each kind is made at, per session
🍎> ⎕TYPE
⍝ expect: UINT64 INT64 REAL64
🍎> ⎕TYPE←'UINT8'
🍎> ⎕TYPE
⍝ expect: UINT8 INT64 REAL64
⍝ naturals wrap at 8 bits
🍎> 200+100
⍝ expect: 44
🍎> 255+1
⍝ expect: 0
🍎> x←2 3⍴250+⍳6
🍎> x
⍝ expect: 251 252 253
⍝ expect: 254 255   0
🍎> +/x
⍝ expect: 244 253
🍎> ⌽x
⍝ expect: 253 252 251
⍝ expect:   0 255 254
🍎> x,7
⍝ expect: 251 252 253 7
⍝ expect: 254 255   0 7
⍝ shapes and indices stay 64-bit; a numeral must fit
🍎> ⍴⍳200
⍝ expect: 200
🍎> ⍴⍳300
⍝ refuse: %domain-error
🍎> ⎕TYPE←'UINT64 INT8'
🍎> ¯100-100
⍝ expect: 56
🍎> ¯128
⍝ expect: ¯128
🍎> ¯129
⍝ refuse: %domain-error
🍎> 127+1
⍝ expect: 128
⍝ reals at 32 bits:  each operation rounds once to single precision
🍎> ⎕TYPE←'INT64 REAL32'
🍎> 1÷3
⍝ expect: 0.33333334
🍎> 0.1+0.2
⍝ expect: 0.3
🍎> 2*0.5
⍝ expect: 1.4142135
🍎> v←0.1×⍳3
🍎> v÷3
⍝ expect: 0.033333335 0.06666667 0.1
🍎> 3|5.5
⍝ expect: 2.5
🍎> 2⍕v
⍝ expect: 0.10 0.20 0.30
🍎> (1.5 2.5)≡1.5 2.5
⍝ expect: 1
🍎> 1E39
⍝ refuse: %domain-error
⍝ ⎕TYPE is local to a dfn
🍎> F←{⎕TYPE←'REAL16' ⋄ ÷⍵}
🍎> F 3
⍝ expect: 0.33325195
🍎> ⎕TYPE
⍝ expect: UINT64 INT64 REAL32
🍎> ⎕TYPE←'REAL16'
🍎> 1÷3
⍝ expect: 0.3333
🍎> 6E4
⍝ expect: 60000
🍎> 7E4
⍝ refuse: %domain-error
⍝ an older array keeps its width until a function makes a new one
🍎> ⎕TYPE←'REAL64'
🍎> v
⍝ expect: 0.1 0.2 0.3
🍎> v+0.1
⍝ expect: 0.2000000015 0.300000003 0.4000000119
🍎> ⎕TYPE←'REAL128'
🍎> ⎕PP←17
🍎> 1÷3
⍝ expect: 0.33333333333333333
🍎> ⎕PP←10
🍎> 1E300×1E300
⍝ expect: 1E600
🍎> ⎕TYPE←'BAD'
⍝ refuse: %domain-error
🍎> ⎕TYPE←1
⍝ refuse: %domain-error
🍎> ⎕TYPE←'UINT64 INT64 REAL64'
🍎> 1÷3
⍝ expect: 0.3333333333
